# Full upstream QEMU source clones - redundant with the authoritative working
# copy on the T480s (~/goldengate/qemu-sptm-cl4-native); way too large to push.
qemu-sptm-patchtest/
darwin-vm/qemu-sptm/

# Large firmware/IPSW binary caches and decrypted Apple firmware - copyrighted
# Apple binaries, shouldn't be redistributed, and too large for git anyway.
darwin-vm/firmware/
darwin-vm/ipsw_db/
darwin-vm/ios_sysroot.tar.gz
darwin-vm-m2/firmware/
darwin-vm-m2/ipsw_db/
darwin-vm-m2/nvram.bin
darwin-vm-m2/__pycache__/

# Local machine artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Raw screendump PPMs - large, uncompressed; the converted .png next to each
# one is the actual useful evidence artifact, keep those.
*.ppm

# Full local copies of the 125MB BootKC binary pulled down for offline
# analysis - redundant with the authoritative copy on the T480s, too large
# to push. Small extracted/patched .c source dumps stay (apple_dcp_live.c,
# darwin_live.c, etc. - those are genuinely useful reference snapshots).
bootkc*.bin
bootkc.audit*

# Handoff docs, session logs, debug dumps, and firmware snapshots - these
# stay local only (T480s + desktop), not in the repo.
ASTRA_LOG.md
FORCLAUDE.md
CLAUDE_MEMORY_NOTES.md
CODEX_HANDOFF*.md
PHASE*_LOG.md
PHASE1B_SUCCESS.md
*.log
gg_gdb*.txt
gg_sample.txt
sptm_bootstrap_props.txt
sptm_dart_strings.txt
forcodexfromopencode*.txt
dtree.mac14_3.*
libbootpolicy_text.bin
